{"id":"n17869-1-7","stage":1,"title":"이런 · 这样的","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17869-1-7-1","ko":"유민이라는 학생이 그렇게 똑똑하다면서요?","zh":"听说叫裕敏的那位学生这么聪明吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이라는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이라는","audio":"/audio/009421cfadb0bb376a42.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이라는","audio":"/audio/009421cfadb0bb376a42.mp3"}},{"text":"학생이","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생이","audio":"/audio/6186fc8f724b430f2130.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"똑똑하다면서요?","meaning":"聪慧","explanation":"똑똑하다：聪慧；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"똑똑하다","audio":"/audio/93e0c2c63740f5689814.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15186","senseId":"2","lemma":"똑똑하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"똑똑하다면서요","audio":"/audio/502ff5c45efc5df8a01e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"93e0c2c63740f568","term":"똑똑하다","zh":"聪慧","audio":"/audio/93e0c2c63740f5689814.mp3","entryId":"15186","definition":"聪明伶俐。","pronunciation":["똑또카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c8d6c09cb4bdd28d684.mp3","speak